The liquidation cascade, the best documented study (backtest):

- Gross rebound measured: +0.034 %.
- Round-trip trading cost: about 0.15 %, more than four times the rebound.
- Traded for a full year with prudent position sizing: −4.7 % per year. With aggressive sizing, the account would have been ruined.
